---
textCode: "540-29"
unit: 江戸幕府の成立
weekCast:
  - tora
  - neko
  - nasu
  - ramen
weekOutline:
  - day: mon
    theme: 江戸のはじまり
    mode: observation
  - day: tue
    theme: 関ヶ原の大きな戦い
    mode: roleplay
    roles: 徳川家康・石田三成
  - day: wed
    theme: 大名をしばるしくみ
    mode: observation
  - day: thu
    theme: 武家諸法度と一国一城令
    mode: roleplay
    roles: 徳川秀忠・以心崇伝
  - day: fri
    theme: 島原の乱と鎖国
    mode: roleplay
